# Given / When / Then in tests

Every `test` / `it` body comments the scenario in Gherkin order:

```js
// Given <precondition>
// When <action>
// Then <observable result>
```

Put each comment immediately above the code it describes. A longer scenario may repeat When / Then. Do not skip the comments because the test name already reads that way.
